they think that this response is evidence that they should stay away from food, right? For example, they really restrict their intake and then they become obsessed with food. They binge when, for example, chocolate is available. Then they think, oh, this just shows that I should stay away from these foods. These foods are bad, right? So it comes that, again, self-fulfilling cycle where you avoid more foods, you have the amount of safe foods become smaller and smaller. But then in response, you start focusing more on other foods, right? I remember during my anorexia, I would get so much satisfaction out of just reading food recipes,
