and it is a really hard psychiatric illness to treat. So what do you think was a contributor to your success or your journey? I think there are several factors here. So I think one of them is that my treatment system was, I was quite lucky with having a good psychologist and having access to treatment, right? Because that's another thing with eating disorder treatments, that very often is quite inaccessible, right? I was in Norway at this point, which is my home country.
