79
00:55:29.000 --> 00:56:02.000
country and there the treatment is completely free of charge and pretty high quality. So I think that I would kind of think that that the privilege of that definitely was a factor. But of course, even in Norway when people have access to treatment, not everyone recovers, right. So that was one thing, having a good treatment support and also good treatment support that's very much echoed the fact that, yeah, you need to eat, you need to put on weight. You can't just sit here and talk endlessly with us and walk around it. in circles and psychoanalyze, you need to eat as well. And we will sort the other things,
